# Trivy findings accepted for the job-tracker-api image (read by the image
# job in .github/workflows/ci.yml).
#
# One CVE per line, with an expiry so every exception gets revisited:
#   CVE-XXXX-YYYY exp:YYYY-MM-DD   # <package>, accepted <date> by <who>: <why>
#
# Nothing ignored yet. ignore-unfixed is on, so only findings with an
# available fix fail the build. Prefer upgrading over adding a line here.
